Package: google-photos-takeout-fixer
Version: __VERSION__
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, perl
Maintainer: Ugo Possenti <ugopossenti@me.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/MEPoss/Google-Photos-Takeout-Fixer
Description: Restore metadata in Google Photos Takeout exports
 Reads the JSON metadata files exported alongside photos and videos by
 Google Takeout and writes date, GPS coordinates and description back
 into the actual media files (EXIF for photos, container metadata for
 videos) using a bundled copy of exiftool. Ships with a small native
 desktop UI (GTK/WebKit2), available in Italian and English.
